ed illustration</span></figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class="atlas shell" id="atlas" aria-labelledby="atlas-title">\n      <div class="section-heading">\n        <h2 id="atlas-title" data-en="Follow your curiosity." data-bg="Последвай любопитството си.">Follow your curiosity.</h2>\n        <p data-en="Six themes, connected by one idea: paying a little more attention. Choose a theme to find a question worth sitting with." data-bg="Шест теми с една обща идея: да обръщаме малко повече внимание. Избери тема и открий въпрос за размисъл.">Six themes, connected by one idea: paying a little more attention. Choose a theme to find a question worth sitting with.</p>\n      </div>\n      <nav class="theme-nav" aria-label="Choose a theme" data-aria-en="Choose a theme" data-aria-bg="Избери тема">\n        <a href="#astrology" data-theme="astrology" data-en="Astrology" data-bg="Астрология">Astrology</a>\n        <a href="#numerology" data-theme="numerology" data-en="Numerology" data-bg="Нумерология">Numerology</a>\n        <a href="#skincare" data-theme="skincare" data-en="Skincare" data-bg="Грижа за кожата">Skincare</a>\n        <a href="#wellbeing" data-theme="wellbeing" data-en="Wellbeing" data-bg="Благополучие">Wellbeing</a>\n        <a href="#family" data-theme="family" data-en="Family & children" data-bg="Семейство и деца">Family &amp; children</a>\n        <a href="#mental-health" data-theme="mental-health" data-en="Mental health" data-bg="Психично здраве">Mental health</a>\n      </nav>\n\n      <section class="chapter chapter-sky" aria-labelledby="sky-title">\n        <div class="chapter-visual">\n          <h3 id="sky-title" data-en="Look up. Look within." data-bg="Поглед навън. Поглед навътре.">Look up. Look within.</h3>\n          <figure><img src="assets/images/sky-study.webp" width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="A pale mineral sphere and amber glass crescent on a stone platform, with leafy stems in soft daylight." data-alt-en="A pale mineral sphere and amber glass crescent on a stone platform, with leafy stems in soft daylight." data-alt-bg="Светла минерална сфера и кехлибарен стъклен полумесец върху каменна платформа, със зелени клонки на мека дневна светлина."></figure>\n        </div>\n        <div class="chapter-topics">\n          <article class="topic" id="astrology" tabindex="-1">\n            <h4 data-en="Astrology" data-bg="Астрология">Astrology</h4>\n            <p data-en="Birth charts, transits and seasonal cycles as a symbolic language for reflection. An invitation to notice patterns, not a prediction to live by." data-bg="Натални карти, транзити и сезонни цикли като символичен език за размисъл. Покана да забелязваш закономерности, не предсказание, което да ръководи живота ти.">Birth charts, transits and seasonal cycles as a symbolic language for reflection. An invitation to notice patterns, not a prediction to live by.</p>\n            <details class="reflection"><summary data-en="A question to explore" data-bg="Въпрос за размисъл">A question to explore</summary><p data-en="Which parts of a description feel familiar, and which do not? Leave room for both instead of letting a label define you." data-bg="Кои части от едно описание ти звучат познато и кои не? Дай място и на двете, вместо да позволяваш на един етикет да те определя.">Which parts of a description feel familiar, and which do not? Leave room for both instead of letting a label define you.</p></details>\n          </article>\n          <article class="topic" id="numerology" tabindex="-1">\n            <h4 data-en="Numerology" data-bg="Нумерология">Numerology</h4>\n            <p data-en="Life paths, repeating numbers and the meanings we give them. A lens for personal interpretation, not scientific evidence or a fixed destiny." data-bg="Жизнени пътища, повтарящи се числа и смисълът, който им придаваме. Гледна точка за лично тълкуване, не научно доказателство или предопределена съдба.">Life paths, re